":["2113148727770918979"],"id":"2113148727770918979","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1486,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"尾盘多只宽基 ETF","url":"https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113148727770918979"},{"author_id":"1734214294978592768","created_at":"2026-10-21T09:24:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112837454172713177"],"id":"2112837454172713177","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1982,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月21日复盘笔记：数据要素/AI传媒/创新药/消费/端侧AI/物理AI/算力租赁/光通信/福建本地等\n\n一、重磅财经信息\n①数字人民币运营管理中心对外公布数字人民币基础设施服务体系，推出央行端数字人民币系统（DCEPS）、数字人民币智能合约生态服务框架两大核心成果。","url":"https://x.com/Anakin_Xu/status/2112837454172713177"},{"author_id":"1913965111045398528","created_at":"2026-10-22T07:07:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113165451702485466"],"id":"2113165451702485466","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":5427,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":1},"text":"注意到了吗？昨天收盘后上交所召开首批主动 ETF","url":"https://x.com/m0sHown5gS16742/status/2113165451702485466"},{"author_id":"1996551578187436033","created_at":"2026-10-22T01:34:05.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113081424970653826"],"id":"2113081424970653826","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":793,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"兄弟们早，盘前瞻送上。\n\n先说隔夜外围，一句话：美股在回血，中概在挨打。","url":"https://x.com/YoooJJ8cm/status/2113081424970653826"},{"author_id":"1993506486069477376","created_at":"2026-10-21T07:46:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112812823298572706"],"id":"2112812823298572706","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"尾盘多只宽基ETF小幅放量\n尾盘创业板ETF易方达（159915）、沪深300ET华泰柏瑞（510300）、沪深300ETF嘉实（159919）、科创50ETF工银（588050）小幅放量，成交额分别90亿、50亿、14亿、5.45亿。","url":"https://x.com/GuHiver/status/2112812823298572706"},{"author_id":"2062811475446779905","created_at":"2026-10-22T11:44:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113235019007172833"],"id":"2113235019007172833","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":61,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"📉 10.22 复盘｜放量下杀，上证跌穿 3700 收 3658，535 家上涨，光模块龙头带头砍，疯了疯了还扛得住嘛\n\n【量能】\n两市成交 15,287 亿，比昨天多 994 亿（+6.95%）。但这是放量下跌：钱是在卖的时候放出来的，不是抢筹。离 1.8 万亿门槛还差 2,700 亿左右，量能这一关依然没过。\n\n【点位】\n上证收","url":"https://x.com/Leodozqa/status/2113235019007172833"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112888982803476480"]},"author_id":"2111841700356440064","created_at":"2026-10-21T12:49:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112889004165079146"],"id":"2112889004165079146","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"宁德时代-12.03%，创历史最大单日跌幅，创业板指-1.62%失守2700点。\n但尾盘出现分歧：创业板ETF成交破100亿，沪深300ETF华泰柏瑞尾盘半小时成交超30亿——指数在跌，“神秘资金”在扫货。\n宁德时代自5月7日历史高点已回落超50%。\n两市成交额1.43万亿，缩量268亿。 https://t.co/wEnIM8nnVg","url":"https://x.com/mrjian2026/status/2112889004165079146"},{"author_id":"823178495253762048","created_at":"2026-10-22T13:08:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113256295553999174"],"id":"2113256295553999174","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":685,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"A股收盘复盘：跨资产定价分化与资金高低切观察\n\n今日A股市场呈现显著的结构性分化与资金再平衡特征。全市场超4990只个股下行，创业板指 收跌4.37%，两市总成交额放大至1.54万亿。  一、宏观定价与汇率锚点","url":"https://x.com/Abijithpa3/status/2113256295553999174"},{"author_id":"2081413952396046336","created_at":"2026-10-21T15:40:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112931994212688037"],"id":"2112931994212688037","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最后10分钟又又突袭今天大跌原因：\n\n1）宁王暴跌12%，由于宁王是创业板第一大权重股，所以把创业板拉下水。\n\n2）其实不止宁王，还有福耀玻璃，格力电器这些公司都在大跌。市场缩量严重，机构如果面临赎回压力，通常会优先卖出流动性最好的大盘股来换取现金垃圾股卖不出去，一卖就跌停。","url":"https://x.com/Mo0n921/status/2112931994212688037"},{"author_id":"1425611034375507970","created_at":"2026-10-21T07:24:53.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112807317334868440"],"id":"2112807317334868440","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":392,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":0},"text":"最后10分钟又突袭，今天大跌原因大概就这几点：\n1）宁王暴跌12%，创业板第一大权重，直接把创业板拉下水。\n2）其实不止宁王，福耀玻璃、格力电器这些也在大跌。市场缩量严重，机构如果面临赎回压力，通常优先卖流动性最好的大盘股换钱，垃圾股根本卖不出去，一卖就跌停。","url":"https://x.com/qing2049/status/2112807317334868440"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112872447464943616","3_2112872454557499393"]},"author_id":"1999693479178567681","created_at":"2026-10-21T11:43:44.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112872459699650897"],"id":"2112872459699650897","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":142,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"10月21日，大A散户心态:\n\n上午牛来了，速归；\n中午“TMD”不玩了，撤；\n临近收盘:GJD出手，抄一把。\n\n​大盘股重挫：\n\n创业板权重股“宁王”暴跌12%，拖累全盘；山西汾酒、亿纬锂能等白马股同步杀跌。市场严重缩量，不排除基金机构为应对基民赎回，被迫抛售流动性好的大盘股变现。\n\n​尾盘偷袭： https://t.co/XIQfpBzCW7","url":"https://x.com/ZoXinkun2O26/status/2112872459699650897"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2112655599595057152"]},"author_id":"1862825645824507904","created_at":"2026-10-20T21:22:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2112655622755975365"],"id":"2112655622755975365","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":553,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"收盘前半小时，有神秘大资金突然集中出手。\n\n科创50ETF成交额突破90亿元，上证50ETF也达到55亿元。\n\n临近收盘的最后8分钟，两只沪深300ETF又加码成交65亿元。 https://t.co/NQ2TPoENvg","url":"https://x.com/ThanksuTrump/status/2112655622755975365"},{"author_id":"2096056678022311936","created_at":"2026-10-22T00:43:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113068761154777380"],"id":"2113068761154777380","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":324,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"text":"周四即将开盘，此时根本睡不着了，市场迎来重磅利好，今天将直接放量、又出大阳线？来不及解释了，直接上重点。","url":"https://x.com/Q9925912/status/211